---

<section class="intro-section section-pad" id="intro">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="intro-grid">
      <div class="intro-label reveal-left">
        <span class="text-eyebrow">01 / Our Philosophy</span>
        <span class="intro-accent-line reveal-line"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="intro-content reveal-right" style="transition-delay: 0.15s;">
        <h2 class="intro-text">
          We have built our reputation as a construction services firm that puts <span class="highlight">people first</span>.
        </h2>
        <p class="intro-subtext">
          Every structure we build reflects our commitment to quality craftsmanship, transparent partnerships, and lasting impact in the communities we serve.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="intro-marquee" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="marquee-track">
        <span>Quality Construction</span>
        <span class="marquee-dot">◆</span>
        <span>Trusted Partnerships</span>
        <span class="marquee-dot">◆</span>
        <span>Built to Last</span>
        <span class="marquee-dot">◆</span>
        <span>People First</span>
        <span class="marquee-dot">◆</span>
        <span>Quality Construction</span>
        <span class="marquee-dot">◆</span>
        <span>Trusted Partnerships</span>
        <span class="marquee-dot">◆</span>
        <span>Built to Last</span>
        <span class="marquee-dot">◆</span>
        <span>People First</span>
        <span class="marquee-dot">◆</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .intro-section {
    background-color: var(--c-white);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .intro-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .intro-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 2.5fr;
      gap: 6rem;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  .intro-label {
    position: relative;
  }

  .intro-accent-line {
    display: block;
    width: 60px;
    height: 2px;
    background-color: var(--c-saffron);
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .intro-text {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.75rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--c-charcoal);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .highlight {
    color: var(--c-saffron);
    font-style: italic;
    position: relative;
  }

  .intro-subtext {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--c-grey);
    max-width: 540px;
  }

  .intro-marquee {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--c-grey-light);
    padding-top: 2rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 10%, black 90%, transparent);
  }

  .marquee-track {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
    animation: marquee 30s linear infinite;
    width: max-content;
  }

  .marquee-track span {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--c-grey-light);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .marquee-dot {
    color: var(--c-accent) !important;
    font-size: 0.5rem !important;
  }
</style>
